    "proof": "Distinct points of 4 times the nonnegative integers are separated by four, so an interval of smaller width contains at most one. Soundness supplies Delta_j, hence the count is exact. If C_j=0, soundness gives L_j<=0. If C_j>=1, then U_j>=4 and U_j-L_j<4, so L_j>0. Every twin belongs to one dyadic block and every bounded collection of blocks is finite, proving the infinitude equivalence.",
